# nabbi UI

Follow root **`DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`**. Platform coding docs do not override brand/UI.

## Hard rules

- **Primary CTA** = yellow `#F6C531` + ink `#12211A` text (never purple / generic blue).
- **Background** = cream `#FAF8F3` (light). Brand greens: sage `#558367`, forest `#1F3328`.
- **No hardcoded brand hex** in feature UI — use semantic tokens (`globals.css` / `constants/theme.ts`).
- **Buttons/chips** = pill radius (`999`); inputs ≈ 12px radius.
- **Hit targets** ≥ 44×44. One primary action per section.
- **Product font** = Poppins (mobile already; web should match — don’t introduce a third family).
- **Forms**: visible labels, error replaces helper, disable submit while loading, Spanish copy.
- Prefer `components/ui` primitives; extend before inventing one-offs.
- Marketing may be expressive; product UI stays token-driven and calm.

When web/mobile disagree on visuals, align to `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`.
